  "translations": [
    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "Snake，你说得对。只要我们还是“无国界军队”，就会成为目标。我们需要足以威慑敌人的力量。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 128,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "辗转各国，我们势必会踏入各种各样的冲突。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 60,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "那些地方的意识形态、地理、政治局势，一切都不一样。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 75,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "要在那种环境下开展军事支援，就需要像Metal Gear那样的威慑力量。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 88,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "……也为了避免落得像在玻利维亚迎来末路的格瓦拉那样。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 78,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "没错。我们<R=无国界军队,MSF>没有自己的土地。是<R=流浪之民,ノーマッド>。就像游牧民一样。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=无国界军队,MSF> <R=流浪之民,ノーマッド>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 124,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "我们需要一条能和我们一起走下去的牧羊犬。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 60,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_ADDS_GUARD_ROLE_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "嗯。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 6,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "也许这和The Boss的做法不同。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 38,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "但是，这个世界上还有需要我们的地方。还有需要MSF的士兵。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 81,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "只要还有这样的需要，我们就不会停下脚步，也不能停止这场旅程。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 90,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 11,
      "cn_text": "我们才是真正的和平行者。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 36,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    }
  ]
}
